      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Are you a fan of Marvel superheroes like Spider-Man"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "蜘蛛侠"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and Iron Man"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "钢铁侠"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "? If so, have you heard of the name, Stan Lee (1922–2018)? He was the man who created those characters with Marvel artists."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Lee was born in New York City, USA. He got his start in storytelling in 1939. The company he worked for then became Marvel Comics"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "漫威漫画公司"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Before Lee, heroes like Superman"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "超人"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " were nearly "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "perfect",
            "ref": "v-perfect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". And they didn’t have the same "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "worries",
            "ref": "v-worry"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " as "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ordinary",
            "ref": "v-ordinary"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " people. Then Lee created Spider-Man. The superhero is also Peter Parker, a lonely high school student."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Lee created many characters. But he said he was most like Parker. “He’s just an ordinary guy. Nothing works out perfectly for him,” he said."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Stan Lee also played cameo"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "客串"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " roles in most Marvel films. He really was the superhero of Marvel."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
